SonarQube integration — external, runtime-downloaded dependencies (NOT bundled):
ide can run and connect to a shared SonarQube Community Edition server and uses
the "SonarQube for IDE" (SonarLint) VS Code extension (SonarSource.sonarlint-vscode)
for connected-mode analysis. Both are LGPL-3.0 and are used ONLY as external,
unmodified dependencies: the SonarQube server image (sonarqube:community) is
pulled from Docker Hub and runs as a separate container; the extension is
downloaded at runtime from Open VSX into the extensions directory and loaded like
any other extension. Neither is vendored into this repository, bundled into the
ide binaries, or patched. See docs/sonarqube.md and exthost/scripts/license-audit.mjs.
